# Credential files. The Google OAuth client downloads as a JSON containing a
# client_secret, and this repository is public — one careless `git add -A`
# would publish it. Supabase only needs the two values pasted into its form,
# so the file should never be here at all; this is the safety net.
client_secret*.json
*credentials*.json
*service-account*.json
.env
.env.*
